## Install

- [Install script for Linux and macOS](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dxsk/repos-manager/main/installers/install.sh): `curl -fsSL <url> | sh`, verifies SHA256SUMS
- [Install script for Windows](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dxsk/repos-manager/main/installers/install.ps1): `irm <url> | iex` in PowerShell
- [crates.io package](https://crates.io/crates/repos-manager): `cargo install repos-manager`
- [AUR package, prebuilt](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/repos-manager-bin): `yay -S repos-manager-bin`
- [AUR package, from source](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/repos-manager): `yay -S repos-manager`
- [Releases](https://github.com/Dxsk/repos-manager/releases/latest): archives, Windows installers, SHA256SUMS

